From: Jiaqi Cheng <chengjiaqi3@huawei.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 14:26:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] ub:ubctl:Enhance the query information of ubctl.

tool inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/ubctl/issues/30
CVE: NA

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

1.UBCTL supports printing relevant register information for
different environments
2.By querying registers at various levels, as well as UE related
information and UPA related information, UBCTL can enhance their ability
to maintain network communication measurement information

Signed-off-by: Jiaqi Cheng <chengjiaqi3@huawei.com>
